## Taxonomic Group
Order Chiroptera

## Objective

This repository documents the phylogenetic analysis of selected bat species using mitochondrial cytochrome c oxidase subunit I (COI) gene sequences retrieved from the NCBI database. The project was conducted using Galaxy for sequence alignment and phylogenetic tree construction.

## Species Included

- Mus musculus (Outgroup)
- Hipposideros diadema
- Rhinolophus arcuatus
- Pteropus vampyrus
- Rousettus amplexicaudatus
- Miniopterus schreibersii
- Cynopterus brachyotis

## Software

- NCBI
- Galaxy
- MAFFT
- FastTree

